### ==============================================================================
### MICROSERVICES DEMO & TEST REQUESTS
### UTS Microservices: Membangun Order Service
### ==============================================================================

@productServiceUrl = http://localhost:3000
@cartServiceUrl = http://localhost:3001
@reviewServiceUrl = http://localhost:3002
@orderServiceUrl = http://localhost:3003

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name HealthOrderService
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
# @name HealthProductService
GET {{productServiceUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
# @name HealthCartService
GET {{cartServiceUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###
# @name HealthReviewService
GET {{reviewServiceUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. PERSIAPAN DATA: SEEDING / VIEWING PRODUCTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Cek Produk ID 1 (Keyboard Mekanikal, Stok 25)
GET {{productServiceUrl}}/products/1
Accept: application/json

###
# Cek Produk ID 2 (Mouse Wireless, Stok 40)
GET {{productServiceUrl}}/products/2
Accept: application/json

###
# Cek Produk ID 3 (Monitor 24 Inch, Stok 10)
GET {{productServiceUrl}}/products/3
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. PERSIAPAN CART (CART-SERVICE)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Kosongkan keranjang user 7 terlebih dahulu
DELETE {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts/7
Accept: application/json

###
# Tambah Produk ID 1 (Keyboard Mekanikal, Qty 2) ke Keranjang User 7
POST {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 7,
  "product_id": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###
# Tambah Produk ID 2 (Mouse Wireless, Qty 1) ke Keranjang User 7
POST {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 7,
  "product_id": 2,
  "quantity": 1
}

###
# Lihat isi keranjang user 7 (Total 3 items)
GET {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts/7
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. POST /orders (CHECKOUT) - SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Skenario 4.1: POST /orders - Gagal Validasi Body Kosong (422)
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
}

### Skenario 4.2: POST /orders - Gagal Keranjang Kosong (409)
# Menggunakan user_id 999 yang tidak memiliki item keranjang
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 999
}

### Skenario 4.3: POST /orders - Gagal Stok Tidak Cukup (409)
# Tambahkan 11 monitor ke user 8 (stok hanya 10)
DELETE {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts/8
Accept: application/json

###
POST {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 8,
  "product_id": 3,
  "quantity": 11
}

###
# Lakukan checkout user 8 (akan gagal 409)
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 8
}

### Skenario 4.4: POST /orders - Sukses Checkout (201)
# Checkout keranjang user 7 yang berisi 2 Keyboard & 1 Mouse
POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "user_id": 7
}

### Verifikasi Keranjang user 7 telah kosong setelah checkout
GET {{cartServiceUrl}}/carts/7
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. GET /orders/{id} (DETAIL ORDER) - SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Skenario 5.1: GET /orders/{id} - Sukses (200)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 5.2: GET /orders/{id} - Gagal Tidak Ditemukan (404)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/999
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 5.3: GET /orders/{id} - Gagal ID Bukan Angka (404)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/abc
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. GET /orders/user/{userId} (DAFTAR PESANAN USER) - SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Skenario 6.1: GET /orders/user/{userId} - Sukses Semua Status (200)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/user/7
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 6.2: GET /orders/user/{userId} - Sukses Filter PENDING (200)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/user/7?status=PENDING
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 6.3: GET /orders/user/{userId} - Gagal Nilai Status Tidak Valid (422)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/user/7?status=SHIPPED
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. PATCH /orders/{id}/pay (SIMULASI BAYAR) - SCENARIOS
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Skenario 7.1: PATCH /orders/{id}/pay - Sukses Bayar PENDING -> PAID (200)
PATCH {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/1/pay
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 7.2: PATCH /orders/{id}/pay - Gagal Sudah Berstatus PAID (409)
PATCH {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/1/pay
Accept: application/json

### Skenario 7.3: PATCH /orders/{id}/pay - Gagal Pesanan Tidak Ditemukan (404)
PATCH {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/999/pay
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. PENGUJIAN SNAPSHOT HARGA
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Cek harga pesanan order ID 1 (misal unit_price 450000)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json

# 2. Ubah harga produk ID 1 di product-service (misal naik jadi 600000)
PUT {{productServiceUrl}}/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Keyboard Mekanikal",
  "price": 600000,
  "stock": 25,
  "image": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNkYPhfDwAChwGA60e6kgAAAABJRU5ErkJggg=="
}

# 3. Buktikan bahwa data di order ID 1 TIDAK BERUBAH (tetap unit_price 450000)
GET {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders/1
Accept: application/json


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. PENGUJIAN KEGAGALAN SERVICE EKSTERNAL (503)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Untuk menguji 503:
# Jalankan di terminal: docker stop product-service
# Lalu kirim request POST /orders untuk user baru dengan item keranjang:
# POST {{orderServiceUrl}}/orders  -> Akan merespons 503 "Product service tidak dapat dihubungi, coba lagi nanti"
# Cek log: docker compose logs order-service
# Nyalakan kembali: docker start product-service
